   <table:table-row table:style-name="ro1"><table:table-cell table:style-name="ce0" office:value-type="string"><text:p>State the reasons which could probably lead to the decision to use another take-off or landing direction than the one into the wind.</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
